  triage:title "Workspace crate-name enumeration logic independently implemented 4x" ;
  triage:description "workspace_package_names-equivalent logic (enumerate workspace crate names from Cargo.toml) is independently implemented 4 times: scripts/validate_release.py, .just/lint_common.py, .github/scripts/release_manifest.py, and legacy scripts/release_artifacts.py, with no shared owner. Note: AT.2 deleting release_artifacts.py reduces this to 3; a shared helper is a possible but not required consolidation. Reported by ruthless-boundary-qa (minor) in QA pass AT-PHASECLOSE-QA-R1." ;
